        (("parallax", "Lyra, say goodnight to the ship for me."), ("lyra", "You can say it yourself."), ("parallax", "Cats do not say goodnight. We go to sleep pointedly.")),
        (("lyra", "I ran a diagnostic on your collar, Parallax. It is in excellent condition."), ("parallax", "So am I."), ("lyra", "I did not run a diagnostic on you."), ("parallax", "You did not need to.")),
